WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Planet Voldor

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.280
I don't like this rain.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:17.810
The main shaft of the structure 
is affecting the planet's core.

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:21.090
Due to its influence on the crust, the weather pattern has changed.

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:23.910
How much has the terrain changed due to the structure's emergence?

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:26.750
It changed by 5.28%. Within error margins.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:30.210
That means we can still use the same map from our last stunt here.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.170
Glad to know we won't be getting lost.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.170
Once you reach the innermost confines of the structure,

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:38.140
Walküre will perform a tactical show.

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:41.640
We know the enemy's security layout,

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.620
but we can't afford to let our guards down.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:45.220
I pray for your success.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:55.530
Kaname?

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:00.680
The last time we were here, Messer was with us.

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:05.750
That's right.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:08.960
Respond, Delta Platoon.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.750
What is it, Captain Larrazabal?

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.300
Multiple Windermerean vessels have de-folded.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.930
Have they realized we're here?

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:20.680
That means we've gotta wrap this up quickly and pull out.

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:22.720
Yes, sir!

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:22.720
Roger.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:23.890
Roger.

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:29.970
<i>Our kiss will send us leaping to the edge of space</i>

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:34.400
<i>Our affection is too hot for mere passionate love</i>

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:39.250
<i>We can be in absolute zero</i>

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:54.050
<i>I'll spark a dream in you</i>

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:58.570
<i>I'll embrace all you believe in</i>

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:01.190
<i>Let your genes go wild</i>

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:08.070
<i>I love you so much, but I try to play it cool sometimes</i>

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:11.920
<i>Tear off my mask and squeeze me to a whole new dimension</i>

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:18.890
<i>By banging into each other, we confirm our uncovered love</i>

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:23.290
<i>The tears we can't cry on our own connect us to the future</i>

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:29.910
<i>Our passionate love will shoot us into a super nova-like state</i>

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:35.800
<i>We can do this! No wounds can hold us back if we're together</i>

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.520
<i>Show me your passion, pray to the skies</i>

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:41.890
<i>Our super big bang will breathe life into a new genesis</i>

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:45.150
<i>We burn our lives for this fusion</i>

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:50.630
<i>We are in absolute zero</i>

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:58.700
The Aerial Knights' mission is to protect the Protoculture structures.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.850
Keith. Theo. Xao.

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:02.880
You will patrol in orbit.

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:04.720
Hermann. Cassim. Bogue.

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:06.510
You will stand by on the surface.

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:08.680
Once the structure's reaction has been observed,

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:12.820
all of you leave atmo along with the research team.

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:13.580
Leave atmo?

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:15.890
I do not understand.

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:17.130
What is happening on Voldor?

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:21.080
Don't worry. These are just security measures.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:25.100
Is His Majesty aware of the details of this experiment?

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:29.180
His Majesty has granted me full authority on the matter.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.420
This is Delta 2.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:47.750
We are in.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:51.880
What is it?

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:56.170
I'm just surprised you didn't disappear like you usually do.

00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:58.670
Surprising, isn't it?

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:16.970
What the hell's up with you?

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:19.740
Do you agree with what we're doing here?

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:25.200
We are activating a system we know 
nothing about on an inhabited planet.

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:28.830
It's a tactical necessity.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.580
I can only feel one wind rise, and it is ominous.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:35.600
Are you saying you won't trust His Majesty and Lord Roid?

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:37.870
I meant no such thing. However...

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:41.800
Some sacrifices must be made. We are at war.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:47.100
One who cannot obey his king is a knight no more.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:51.310
Just fold your wings and return 
to your precious apple fields.

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:07.200
Th-Thanks.

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:09.100
S-Sure.

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:19.400
So far, so good.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.920
Yeah. Reina's hacking did the trick.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:25.100
Still, we shouldn't let our guards down.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.520
Let's get to it.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:27.130
Captain...

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:30.210
What is it?

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:32.520
Why did you team them up?

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:37.870
We can't afford to let them mope around.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:42.200
We need both Freyja's songs and Hayate's prowess.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:45.220
They must overcome their difficulties.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:49.780
I had no idea Hayate's father did such a terrible thing.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:55.710
Were you close to him, Captain?

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.240
He was my superior officer.

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:02.710
And you still took in Hayate despite all that?

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:06.780
I was going to tell him eventually.

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:13.750
When I checked his profile, it only said his father was a NUNS soldier who died in action.

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:18.980
The bigger an organization, the more secrets it hides.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:22.320
Does that go for you too?

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:27.820
Every rug has a few secrets swept under them.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.950
Well, that's just life.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:41.520
This won't work.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:43.210
We need to find another route.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:55.440
Not a knight anymore, huh?

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:00.520
You can't grow good apples here.

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:10.780
Apples?

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:15.080
Let me go! Let me go!

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:18.540
What do you want from me?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:20.760
It's you?!

00:07:23.610 --> 00:07:27.450
Nothing. As long as you don't try anything funny.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:32.130
Apparently I'm a knight no longer.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.010
You had an apple orchard, right?

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.350
I'm Cassim from Exder.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:42.750
Ah, that's just on the other side of the hills!

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:43.190
What?

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:45.820
I'm from Ravengras!

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:50.520
Ravengras? Do you know Ol' Gustav then?

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:53.650
Is that even a question? He's the head of our village.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:59.350
His apples are gosh darn delicious.

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:02.630
I'd always lose to his at the apple fairs.

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:13.940
Have one.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:18.320
Freyja!

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:21.950
Where did she go?

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:34.590
If you won't marry me, I'll tear off my rune and kill myself!

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:36.430
He was yelling that while crying his eyes out.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:39.370
No surprise Erica rejected such a loser.

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:40.540
Freyja!

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:41.540
Hayate?

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:47.420
I knew you would've been with her.

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:48.810
Hayate?

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.920
Whatever. Sit.

00:08:58.090 --> 00:08:59.060
Sit.

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:04.400
Are you okay?

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:08.000
What were you talking about?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:12.640
How Erica and her now husband eloped.

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:13.110
Huh?

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:16.280
Are you here to destroy the structure?

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:20.940
Is that your answer?

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:24.830
Are you sure about this?

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:28.420
That man sitting next to you is from Earth.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:33.400
Windermereans can't live without 
the winds of Windermere.

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:34.970
It will only get harder.

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:37.720
Who the hell are you to decide for us?

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:41.720
Earthling, how old are you?

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.600
Seventeen.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:47.730
Seventeen? That's how old I was when my son was born.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:51.190
My son. He's turning six this year.

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:59.900
When I was six, my father gave me an apple sapling to look after by myself.

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:06.750
I worked hard raising it, and six 
years later it bore its first fruit.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:14.000
Even if I gave my son a sapling now, I may not be there to see its fruits.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.420
That's the life of a Windermerean.

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:20.870
Go home, Freyja.

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:21.960
Now I can he—

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:22.850
No way!

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.570
There are songs I want to sing,

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:30.980
and I have people I want to sing with.

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:34.690
There are people I want to sing to.

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:43.190
I don't know how to end the war,

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:45.340
and I don't know what's the right thing to do.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.780
But I want to sing as long as I live.

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:51.500
I belong with Walküre.

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:58.760
Our lives are too short to walk alongside Earthlings.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:05.690
Then ya should just make ev'ry day a thousand darn times better!

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:06.430
Together!

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:09.560
Hayate...

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:16.940
This is Delta 2. We have reached the target.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:21.940
Copy that. Continue with your preparations as planned.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:22.700
Roger.

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.010
This wind...

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:50.960
Is this... fear?

00:11:57.070 --> 00:12:05.120
<i>You were always left behind,</i>

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:14.120
<i>so you just watched from where you stood</i>

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:15.770
Mikumo?!

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:25.360
<i>Counting the sacrifices it takes to achieve something,</i>

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:27.210
We've picked up signals coming from the structure.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:34.120
<i>you just stood there hiding your tears</i>

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:30.390
What's going on? His Majesty hasn't begun singing yet.

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:33.840
Is it Walküre?

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:35.440
What shall you do?

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:42.280
<i>Your eyes are so sincere and pure,</i>

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:38.210
Let them sing.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.520
Mikumo, the others aren't—

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:53.410
<i>but you never saw this world that way</i>

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:46.740
It's fine! Let her sing!

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:49.660
Walküre! Team up with Mikumo!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:51.830
Delta Platoon! Cover them with your Siegfrieds!

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.070
Roger!

00:12:53.680 --> 00:13:02.260
<i>Dreams aren't something you have by yourself</i>

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:06.830
<i>An invisible wind...</i>

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:04.600
Mikumo?

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:05.580
Go.

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:08.230
Before I put this on.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.710
You're letting us go?

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.820
I also don't know what the right thing to do is.

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:19.860
But until the fight is over and 
our wings turn white again—

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:24.320
No, until I can return to the fields of apple blooming white,

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:27.830
I am a winged knight.

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:34.580
I will show no mercy in the sky.

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:35.640
Fine.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:37.750
Let's go.

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:42.590
I'm Cassim Ebelhart.

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:46.130
Hayate Immelmann.

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:52.950
Immelmann?

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:00.410
Thanks, Hayate!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.250
I'll sing.

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:05.900
For our friends, and for you!

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:08.980
And I'll fly.

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:11.780
To protect Walküre and you!

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:19.670
Sorry for the wait!

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:33.810
<i>Inside this storm of emotions,</i>

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:31.970
Fre-Fre!

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:35.550
Hurry, Hayate!

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:40.120
<i>I feel like I'll forget who I really am</i>

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:36.390
On it!

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:45.980
<i>I'm being bombarded by worries and uncertainties</i>

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:52.320
<i>The only way to win is to admit my weakness</i>

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:55.370
<i>If it weren't me</i>

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.370
<i>If it weren't you</i>

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:04.670
<i>I don't think we could've ever felt this way</i>

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:10.090
<i>Swing your blade into the darkness of justice</i>

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.630
Incoming, ten o'clock!

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.380
The Aerial Knights!

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:13.260
<i>Run until you burn out and turn into ashes</i>

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:18.060
<i>Throw out all reasons and just scream from your heart</i>

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:16.800
Intercept the enemy once you've 
deployed your multi-drones!

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:18.060
Roger!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:22.310
<i>Cut loose before I am born into the galaxy</i>

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:21.050
Detecting fold broadcast from Voldor.

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:21.830
Analyzing data.

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:24.570
Delta Platoon in combat with Windermerean forces.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:25.360
<i>If you're still there when I'm there</i>

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:33.570
<i>We can become invincible together</i>

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.190
Found you!

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.820
You impure woman.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:32.070
I'll make you pay for tarnishing 
the honor of a winged knight!

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:37.540
Rei-Rei!

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:50.990
<i>Everyone lives every day like a routine</i>

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:49.340
Freyja?!

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:55.930
<i>I don't want to live meaninglessly</i>

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:57.660
Dammit!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:16:01.930
<i>I don't want to live like I'm dead</i>

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:05.570
<i>I want to bleed and take out my fangs</i>

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:03.810
What?!

00:16:05.570 --> 00:16:12.400
<i>That's how you and I know we're alive</i>

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:20.040
<i>Break me; feel me closer and stronger</i>

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:19.140
Hayate's receptor values are rising rapidly.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:22.920
<i>Hello? Are you there?</i>

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:24.250
He's reacting to Freyja's bio-fold 
waves extremely strongly!

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:28.060
<i>My life blooms on the battlefield, burning away</i>

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.500
That's...

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:29.670
They're in sync.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:32.050
<i>Kill me now before I dry up and die</i>

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:31.440
Enemies incoming from above!

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:35.290
<i>I will flare up my entire existence</i>

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:44.120
<i>And make miracles happen under this suffocating sky</i>

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.310
This wind...

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:50.530
Is this it?

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:54.030
Have His Majesty sing.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:21.320
We are detecting extremely powerful bio-fold waves.

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:24.640
It's many times stronger than 
what we measured on Ragna!

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.600
What about Walküre's tactical show?

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:29.310
The bio-fold waves' interference 
makes it difficult to continue.

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:33.740
I'm gonna get you this time!

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:58.090
His Majesty's bio-fold waves are being disturbed.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:00.510
Is it the effect of the Protoculture structure?

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.500
Heinz...

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:12.980
I won't let you get in His Majesty's way!

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:16.670
No!

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:20.950
Hayate!

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:26.400
<i>I stand on the burning wreckage</i>

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:32.460
<i>I don't know for how long or why at all</i>

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:37.920
<i>The flames around are drowning me</i>

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:43.810
<i>Finding what I seek feels so pointless now</i>

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:49.940
<i>Break the world and go beyond the ecstasy of the past</i>

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:46.930
The wind's blowing against us!

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:47.930
What?

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:49.650
It's calling me.

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:56.440
<i>Choose the future even if it's the inferior option</i>

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.360
<i>Let's fly</i>

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:00.280
<i>Love forever till the limit</i>

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:03.460
<i>Dance until we go crazy</i>

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:04.790
Bio-fold waves have covered 65% of the planet's surface.

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:09.040
<i>And our souls will merge together, yeah</i>

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:09.790
Voldorians' brainwaves are displaying an abnormal coherent pulse phenomenon.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.750
<i>If we try to move from there</i>

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:11.180
Very good.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:13.760
Record the inhabitants' brainwave tuning.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:14.750
<i>If our feelings reach the sky</i>

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:14.750
Sir!

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:17.510
Tuning?

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:20.600
<i>Then we'll lose our purity</i>

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.460
<i>Purity</i>

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.850
<i>Purity</i>

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:29.230
<i>Purity</i>

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:32.100
<i>Purity</i>

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.980
<i>Purity</i>

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:39.440
Mega-fold gates detected around the structure !

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:42.760
Al-Shahal, Ragna, Randall, Alfheim...

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:47.120
The same thing is occurring at all Protoculture structures in the globular cluster!

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:50.960
Bio-fold wave resonance rates still rising!

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:53.710
The structure's out of control.

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:55.590
We can't keep this up.

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:15.620
<i>I love you</i>

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:18.480
<i>This will be the last game over</i>

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:18.480
Freyja!

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:21.150
<i>If we lost everything again</i>

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:27.240
<i>Our souls will cut loose from all troubles, yeah</i>

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:29.400
Freyja's showing abnormal waveforms!

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:30.000
<i>If we go back to the days we were born</i>

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.860
<i>If we go to sleep as we die</i>

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.500
Freyja!

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:39.180
<i>Then we'll find a mild sensation</i>

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:44.220
Freyja...

00:20:49.610 --> 00:20:51.980
The wind stopped?

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:05.410
Rudanjal Rom Mayan!

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:11.980
<i>Love forever until the very end</i>

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:15.550
<i>Sing so hard until it hurts</i>

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:22.550
<i>Until the soul is reincarnated</i>

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:26.220
<i>But if you still want to sing then</i>

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:26.220
What's this wind?!

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:29.470
<i>If you want to bet all on living</i>

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:36.230
<i>The purity of your heart will destroy everything</i>

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:42.650
<i>Ah, believe in me, baby</i>

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:53.100
<i>I'll forgive you in a chaotic climax</i>

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:10.250
Mission 18: Sense Emergence

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:19.170
<i>Should go</i>

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:29.610
<i>My love thunder grows for you</i>

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:34.830
<i>Like a northern blue</i>

00:22:37.800 --> 00:22:45.920
<i>My desire is spinning in a spiral</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:57.080
<i>It'd be ridiculous if this was the world inside a mirror</i>

00:22:57.080 --> 00:23:07.520
<i>I ran away from sparks of flame, so I wouldn't break</i>

00:23:07.520 --> 00:23:15.870
<i>I kept my fuse tucked away and hidden</i>

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:19.640
<i>The surface of the water shakes sharply</i>

00:23:19.640 --> 00:23:25.570
<i>I need the trigger to make dreams overflow</i>

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:30.420
<i>SOS, I'm sending out a signal</i>

00:23:30.420 --> 00:23:36.720
<i>Because I couldn't believe that it could kill me</i>

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:39.730
Next time: Eternal Songs
